-- Selling prices for bills, set by the owner on 2026-09-26 (from the price sheet), stored in platform_config so they can change without an app release.
--
--   data_selling_prices      what customers pay for each data plan, by network and the provider's exact plan name. The clubkonnect function's
--                            "data-plans" action swaps these in for the provider's own price (plan_amount = selling price, cost_amount = provider price).
--   print_airtime_prices     what customers pay per Print Airtime PIN, by network and face value (₦100 / 200 / 300 / 500 / 1000).
--   print_data_discount_pct  Print Data is sold at the data selling price minus this percentage (2 = 2% off, rounded to the naira).
--   bundle_set_enabled       Bundle Set is PAUSED ('false'); set to 'true' to bring the tile back.
--
-- Normal airtime is a flat rate (face value) for everyone and has no row here. To change a price later, edit the JSON value (admin portal or a new
-- migration like this one); nothing in the app has to be rebuilt.
